<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">See you tomorrow! 🗓</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, a quick reminder that <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> is tomorrow.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;">
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Date</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{eventDate}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Time</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{eventTime}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Venue</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{location}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Coordinator</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{coordinatorName}} · {{coordinatorMobile}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5E6E7E;font-size:13px;">Your coordinator is your first point of contact on the day. If you can no longer make it, please withdraw in the portal so your seat can be offered to the waitlist.</p>
